question 'Which statement best describes "human-centered reliability" in the context of app design?'

wrong 'Ensuring that an app\'s code has no bugs so it never fails under any circumstances'
right 'Designing an app to remain transparent and helpful to users even when technical problems occur'
wrong 'Building apps that automatically detect and fix their own errors without any developer intervention'
wrong 'Optimizing an app to reduce the total number of server requests it makes per session'

